Allez, apprenez des trucs, et revenez m’faire une démonstration.' WHERE l.`ID` = 24752 AND l.`locale` = 'frFR' AND (l.`QuestDescription` IS NULL OR l.`QuestDescription` = '' OR BINARY l.`QuestDescription` = BINARY q.`QuestDescription`);
